[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4070513219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117486#issuecomment-4070513219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117486","id":4070513219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ynxpD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T20:49:54Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T20:49:54Z","body":"Given the description this sounds like:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115782","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4070513219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4070599668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117486#issuecomment-4070599668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117486","id":4070599668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yoGv0","user":{"login":"SpandexEnthusiast","id":268720000,"node_id":"U_kgDOEARXgA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268720000?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast","html_url":"https://github.com/SpandexEnthusiast","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T21:07:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T21:07:02Z","body":"Oh.  That may be.  I guess I sure did suck at searching and did not spot that.  \n\nHowever, with the button starting in focus, with no other controls to grab focus, I don't think it makes sense for clicking around to cause the currently in-focus button to lose focus and don't fully understand why the suggested setting makes it work like it was before.\n\nIt sounds like \"Always\" and \"Control Supports Keyboard Input\" should be doing the same thing, as these buttons are controlled via keyboard inputs. \n\nAll mouse related features have been turned off, and focus is strictly via keyboard.\n\nIdeally, I would like the whole scene to just \"not respond\" to mouse activities.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4070599668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4070604350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117486#issuecomment-4070604350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117486","id":4070604350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yoH4-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T21:08:04Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T21:08:04Z","body":"That's a good discussion to have","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4070604350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4073647310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117486#issuecomment-4073647310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117486","id":4073647310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yzuzO","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-17T09:47:50Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T09:54:11Z","body":"Looks like if parent is a Control node and mouse is set to ignore (or you click outside the area of the parent, if it set to stop) then focus is lost. \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56f0ad56-e098-48a1-85c2-d9b0e6c5c1de\n\nEdit: You can still use space/enter to trigger button press, so it only looks like focus it lost.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4073647310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4073778892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117486#issuecomment-4073778892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117486","id":4073778892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7y0O7M","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-17T10:08:44Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T10:08:44Z","body":"> When a Texture Button is in focus, click anywhere (**including on the button itself**). It will revert to normal texture and seemingly lose focus.\n\nThere was a comment in the original PR about focus changing when clicking on a button that has focus already: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110250#issuecomment-3272417185","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4073778892/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4075359049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117486#issuecomment-4075359049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117486","id":4075359049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7y6QtJ","user":{"login":"SpandexEnthusiast","id":268720000,"node_id":"U_kgDOEARXgA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268720000?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast","html_url":"https://github.com/SpandexEnthusiast","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpandexEnthusiast/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-17T14:22:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T14:22:36Z","body":"> Looks like if parent is a Control node and mouse is set to ignore (or you click outside the area of the parent, if it set to stop) then focus is lost.\n> \n>  Screencast_20260317_104643.webm \n> Edit: You can still use space/enter to trigger button press, so it only looks like focus it lost.\n\nIt does this even if the button is the only available control in the scene (See attached MRP).\n\nI have a canvas layer with a sprite2d texture, and a single button.  \n\nWhere is the focus going to?  I can lose focus by clicking away, but obviously can't regain it via the same clicking since the buttons are ignoring mouse actions.\n\nTo me, if something that is ignoring clicks has focus, it shouldn't lose focus to a click that is associated to nothing.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/